{"suttaId":"thag17.3","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[3810,3920],"vripara":"1017"},"segments":{"thag17.3:0.4":"Ānandattheragāthā","thag17.3:1.1":"“Pisuṇena ca kodhanena ca, maccharinā ca vibhūtanandinā;","thag17.3:1.3":"Sakhitaṃ na kareyya paṇḍito, pāpo kāpurisena saṅgamo.","thag17.3:2.1":"“Saddhena ca pesalena ca, paññavatā bahussutena ca;","thag17.3:2.3":"Sakhitaṃ kareyya paṇḍito, bhaddo sappurisena saṅgamo.","thag17.3:3.1":"“Passa cittakataṃ bimbaṃ … pe … yassa natthi dhuvaṃ ṭhiti.","thag17.3:4.1":"“Passa cittakataṃ bimbaṃ … pe … vatthehi sobhati.","thag17.3:5.1":"“Alattakakatā … pe … no ca pāragavesino.","thag17.3:6.1":"“Aṭṭhapadakatā … pe … no ca pāragavesino.","thag17.3:7.1":"“Añjanīva navā … pe … no ca pāragavesino.","thag17.3:8.1":"“Bahussuto cittakathī, buddhassa paricārako;","thag17.3:8.3":"Pannabhāro visaññutto, seyyaṃ kappeti gotamo.","thag17.3:9.1":"“Khīṇāsavo visaññutto, saṅgātīto sunibbuto;","thag17.3:9.3":"Dhāreti antimaṃ dehaṃ, jātimaraṇapāragū.","thag17.3:10.1":"“Yasmiṃ patiṭṭhitā dhammā, buddhassādiccabandhuno;","thag17.3:10.3":"Nibbānagamane magge, soyaṃ tiṭṭhati gotamo.","thag17.3:11.1":"“Dvāsīti buddhato gaṇhiṃ, dve sahassāni bhikkhuto;","thag17.3:11.3":"Caturāsītisahassāni, ye me dhammā pavattino.","thag17.3:12.1":"“Appassutāyaṃ puriso, balibaddova jīrati;","thag17.3:12.3":"Maṃsāni tassa vaḍḍhanti, paññā tassa na vaḍḍhati.","thag17.3:13.1":"“Bahussuto appassutaṃ, yo sutenātimaññati;","thag17.3:13.3":"Andho padīpadhārova, tatheva paṭibhāti maṃ.","thag17.3:14.1":"“Bahussutaṃ upāseyya, sutañca na vināsaye;","thag17.3:14.3":"Taṃ mūlaṃ brahmacariyassa, tasmā dhammadharo siyā.","thag17.3:15.1":"“Pubbāparaññū atthaññū, niruttipadakovido;","thag17.3:15.3":"Suggahītañca gaṇhāti, atthañcopaparikkhati.","thag17.3:16.1":"“Khantyā chandikato [khantiyā chandito (?)] hoti, ussahitvā tuleti taṃ;","thag17.3:16.3":"Samaye so padahati, ajjhattaṃ susamāhito.","thag17.3:17.1":"“Bahussutaṃ dhammadharaṃ, sappaññaṃ buddhasāvakaṃ;","thag17.3:17.3":"Dhammaviññāṇamākaṅkhaṃ, taṃ bhajetha tathāvidhaṃ.","thag17.3:18.1":"“Bahussuto dhammadharo, kosārakkho mahesino;","thag17.3:18.3":"Cakkhu sabbassa lokassa, pūjanīyo bahussuto.","thag17.3:19.1":"“Dhammārāmo dhammarato, dhammaṃ anuvicintayaṃ;","thag17.3:19.3":"Dhammaṃ anussaraṃ bhikkhu, saddhammā na parihāyati.","thag17.3:20.1":"“Kāyamaccheragaruno [garuko (sī.)], hiyyamāne [hiyyamāno (sī.)] anuṭṭhahe;","thag17.3:20.3":"Sarīrasukhagiddhassa, kuto samaṇaphāsutā.","thag17.3:21.1":"“Na pakkhanti disā sabbā, dhammā na paṭibhanti maṃ;","thag17.3:21.3":"Gate kalyāṇamittamhi, andhakāraṃva khāyati.","thag17.3:22.1":"“Abbhatītasahāyassa, atītagatasatthuno;","thag17.3:22.3":"Natthi etādisaṃ mittaṃ, yathā kāyagatā sati.","thag17.3:23.1":"“Ye purāṇā atītā te, navehi na sameti me;","thag17.3:23.3":"Svajja ekova jhāyāmi, vassupetova pakkhimā.","thag17.3:24.1":"“Dassanāya abhikkante, nānāverajjake bahū;","thag17.3:24.3":"Mā vārayittha sotāro, passantu samayo mamaṃ.","thag17.3:25.1":"“Dassanāya abhikkante, nānāverajjake puthu;","thag17.3:25.3":"Karoti satthā okāsaṃ, na nivāreti cakkhumā.","thag17.3:26.1":"“Paṇṇavīsativassāni, sekhabhūtassa me sato;","thag17.3:26.3":"Na kāmasaññā uppajji, passa dhammasudhammataṃ.","thag17.3:27.1":"“Paṇṇavīsativassāni, sekhabhūtassa me sato;","thag17.3:27.3":"Na dosasaññā uppajji, passa dhammasudhammataṃ.","thag17.3:28.1":"“Paṇṇavīsativassāni, bhagavantaṃ upaṭṭhahiṃ;","thag17.3:28.3":"Mettena kāyakammena, chāyāva anapāyinī [anupāyinī (syā. ka.)].","thag17.3:29.1":"“Paṇṇavīsativassāni, bhagavantaṃ upaṭṭhahiṃ;","thag17.3:29.3":"Mettena vacīkammena, chāyāva anapāyinī.","thag17.3:30.1":"“Paṇṇavīsativassāni, bhagavantaṃ upaṭṭhahiṃ;","thag17.3:30.3":"Mettena manokammena, chāyāva anapāyinī.","thag17.3:31.1":"“Buddhassa caṅkamantassa, piṭṭhito anucaṅkamiṃ;","thag17.3:31.3":"Dhamme desiyamānamhi, ñāṇaṃ me udapajjatha.","thag17.3:32.1":"“Ahaṃ sakaraṇīyomhi, sekho appattamānaso;","thag17.3:32.3":"Satthu ca parinibbānaṃ, yo amhaṃ anukampako.","thag17.3:33.1":"“Tadāsi yaṃ bhiṃsanakaṃ, tadāsi lomahaṃsanaṃ;","thag17.3:33.3":"Sabbākāravarūpete, sambuddhe parinibbute.","thag17.3:34.1":"“Bahussuto dhammadharo, kosārakkho mahesino;","thag17.3:34.3":"Cakkhu sabbassa lokassa, ānando parinibbuto.","thag17.3:35.1":"“Bahussuto dhammadharo, kosārakkho mahesino;","thag17.3:35.3":"Cakkhu sabbassa lokassa, andhakāre tamonudo.","thag17.3:36.1":"“Gatimanto satimanto, dhitimanto ca yo isi;","thag17.3:36.3":"Saddhammadhārako thero, ānando ratanākaro.","thag17.3:37.1":"“Pariciṇṇo mayā satthā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ;","thag17.3:37.3":"Ohito garuko bhāro, natthi dāni punabbhavo”ti.","thag17.3:37.5":"… Ānando thero ….","thag17.3:37.6":"Tiṃsanipāto niṭṭhito.","thag17.3:38.0":"Tatruddānaṃ –","thag17.3:38.1":"Phussopatisso ānando, tayotime pakittitā;","thag17.3:38.3":"Gāthāyo tattha saṅkhātā, sataṃ pañca ca uttarīti;"},"attha":null,"tika":null}
